-- THE JOIN as a value under a LEST other than a SHANT's (§2.6 card A3, B1):
-- the LEST runs because the join did NOT fire, so there is no join to read.
-- Refused as OF THE JOIN is there (anchor-lest-join.l4).

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor
    Pay  HAS amount IS A NUMBER

alice MEANS Tenant OF "Alice"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    PARTY alice MUST Sign alice WITHIN 10
    LEST (PARTY alice MUST Sign alice WITHIN 0 OF (THE JOIN PLUS 5))
